            "comprehends": [
             "copies/mz508vq7890#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded medium on the figures of the date: one figure is arguable. Pencil on dark paper. The three figure pairs read 12, 10 and 09, the last with a clear descender on the 9. The name is less secure than the figures: read as Kopf, but the letters are cramped."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
